<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Unza 6-mth net up 9.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Unza 6-mth net up 9.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4.82   vs	   4.42</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 32.50   vs	  29.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		    59.44   vs	  55.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     6.75   vs	   6.09</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    12.0    vs	   7.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Unza Holdings Bhd makes personal hygiene and household products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
